<section class="usecase-deep">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHead
      eyebrow="Use Cases"
      heading="Where is Predictivo used?"
      description="Anywhere IoT data needs to become manageable operations, Predictivo acts as a connectivity layer, an analytics engine, and a decision-support dashboard."
    />
    <div class="uc-grid" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="100">
      <article class="uc-card">
        <div class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 14l3-3 3 3 4-5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Predictive Maintenance</h3>
        <p>Vibration, temperature, current, and operating data are analyzed to detect failure risk early. Unexpected downtime becomes planned maintenance.</p>
        <div class="uc-metrics">
          <div class="uc-m"><div class="v">↓ Downtime</div><div class="l">failure risk</div></div>
          <div class="uc-m"><div class="v">Auto</div><div class="l">work order</div></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="uc-card">
        <div class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Energy Monitoring &amp; Efficiency</h3>
        <p>Electricity, gas, water, and steam consumption are monitored in real time. Costs per line, shift, and product become transparent; targets are automatically tracked with the rule engine.</p>
        <div class="uc-metrics">
          <div class="uc-m"><div class="v">↓ 15%</div><div class="l">typical savings</div></div>
          <div class="uc-m"><div class="v">RT</div><div class="l">live monitoring</div></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="uc-card">
        <div class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"/></svg></div>
        <h3>OEE &amp; Production Performance</h3>
        <p>Machine uptime, quality, and performance data combine into a single score. OEE becomes transparent by shift, line, and product.</p>
        <div class="uc-metrics">
          <div class="uc-m"><div class="v">OEE</div><div class="l">live score</div></div>
          <div class="uc-m"><div class="v">Shift</div><div class="l">comparison</div></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="uc-card">
        <div class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>RTLS &amp; Location Tracking</h3>
        <p>Beacon, UWB, or RFID-based positioning tracks the location of equipment, personnel, or assets in real time; zone violations, asset loss, and working-time tracking turn into automatic actions.</p>
        <div class="uc-metrics">
          <div class="uc-m"><div class="v">RT</div><div class="l">live location</div></div>
          <div class="uc-m"><div class="v">Geo-fence</div><div class="l">zone alerts</div></div>
        </div>
